WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.675 --> 00:00:14.776
felt the cave wall.

2
00:00:15.836 --> 00:00:17.316
He realized it was a door.

3
00:00:19.097 --> 00:00:21.858
He was about to open it when he heard voices.

4
00:00:25.679 --> 00:00:27.379
He looked through the crack again.

5
00:00:27.399 --> 00:00:29.560
"The fan thief!"

6
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:30.420
he thought.

7
00:00:31.828 --> 00:00:33.789
The girl was with a group of people.

8
00:00:33.809 --> 00:00:38.332
"Uncle Mok, look at this pretty fan I stole!"

9
00:00:38.672 --> 00:00:39.192
she said.

10
00:00:43.575 --> 00:00:46.076
fan is useless, Nabi," Mok said.

11
00:00:46.096 --> 00:00:51.119
"Yeah, go steal something useful," another person said.

12
00:00:51.139 --> 00:00:53.941
"We can toss the fan in the fire."

13
00:00:56.922 --> 00:00:59.544
Hearing this, Gildong burst through the door.

14
00:01:02.104 --> 00:01:03.125
"Give me my fan!"

15
00:01:03.485 --> 00:01:04.185
he shouted.

16
00:01:08.028 --> 00:01:09.749
Nabi tossed the fan to Mok.

17
00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:13.431
"See, the little lord really wants it back.

18
00:01:14.411 --> 00:01:15.812
It must be valuable."

19
00:01:17.433 --> 00:01:19.354
Gildong shook his fist at Mok.

20
00:01:19.374 --> 00:01:22.116
"Give it back, or I'll fight you!"

21
00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:26.902
Mok looked at the boy and let out a loud laugh.

22
00:01:28.142 --> 00:01:29.423
Everyone else laughed too.

23
00:01:31.404 --> 00:01:33.225
Gildong's face turned red.

24
00:01:33.245 --> 00:01:35.767
"This is your last chance.

25
00:01:36.207 --> 00:01:38.188
Give it back, or you'll be sorry!"

26
00:01:40.449 --> 00:01:42.510
The group roared with laughter again.

27
00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:49.394
"Grr." Gildong went over to a huge rock and picked it up.

28
00:01:50.334 --> 00:01:52.896
The laughter stopped as he lifted it over his head.

29
00:01:54.496 --> 00:01:57.558
He held it with one hand and glared at Mok.

30
00:01:57.578 --> 00:02:00.359
"Now will you give my fan back?"

31
00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:03.861
Mok tossed the fan to Gildong.

32
00:02:07.463 --> 00:02:08.163
don't harm us!"

33
00:02:09.884 --> 00:02:11.645
Gildong set the rock down.

34
00:02:16.208 --> 00:02:17.908
I took it," Nabi said.

35
00:02:17.929 --> 00:02:21.130
"Uncle Mok told me to steal something valuable.

36
00:02:22.131 --> 00:02:24.252
And that was all you had when I found you, my lord."

37
00:02:25.844 --> 00:02:27.765
"I'm not a lord," Gildong said.

38
00:02:27.785 --> 00:02:29.945
"My father is a noble.

39
00:02:30.705 --> 00:02:31.866
But my mother was a servant.

40
00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:34.567
So that makes me a lowborn commoner."

41
00:02:37.527 --> 00:02:39.568
Mok put his arm around Gildong.

42
00:02:40.988 --> 00:02:42.649
"We're all commoners too.

43
00:02:43.549 --> 00:02:44.629
We should stick together.

44
00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:46.530
Why don't you join us?

45
00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:48.510
You're strong.

46
00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:50.051
You can probably read and write.

47
00:02:51.611 --> 00:02:53.592
Our group could use a smart guy like you."

48
00:02:55.136 --> 00:02:55.696
"Join you?

49
00:02:56.777 --> 00:02:57.557
What do you do?"

50
00:02:57.857 --> 00:02:58.778
Gildong asked.

51
00:02:58.798 --> 00:03:03.880
"We're just a humble group that sticks together," Mok said.

52
00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:07.661
"We go out and take things from people when we need them."

53
00:03:08.862 --> 00:03:09.962
Gildong blinked.

54
00:03:11.343 --> 00:03:12.563
"You mean you're thieves?"

55
00:03:14.184 --> 00:03:15.824
"We only do it to survive!"

56
00:03:16.205 --> 00:03:16.905
Nabi said.

57
00:03:16.925 --> 00:03:20.586
"Well Gildong thought for a moment.

58
00:03:21.727 --> 00:03:24.088
He didn't want to stay with a group of thieves.

59
00:03:25.408 --> 00:03:27.289
But he didn't have anywhere else to go.

60
00:03:27.309 --> 00:03:30.050
"I guess I'll stay here for now."

61
00:03:31.391 --> 00:03:32.431
The group cheered.

62
00:03:32.451 --> 00:03:38.454
"Hip-hip-hooray for—" "What's your name?"

63
00:03:38.854 --> 00:03:39.634
Nabi asked.

64
00:03:42.035 --> 00:03:43.076
"Hong Gildong."

65
00:03:45.337 --> 00:03:47.438
Mok patted Gildong on the back.

66
00:03:48.498 --> 00:03:52.680
"Tonight we will have a feast to welcome Hong Gildong!"
